msgid "7. Understanding the three search methods"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/make_your_data_agent_searchable.rst:346
#: 4a7eac78fd7143ca8b741b2b3ba10c27
msgid ""
"When agents query your collection, they use **hybrid search by default** "
"— a blend of keyword precision and semantic understanding. You can ask "
"the agent to search by keyword, embedding, or hybrid! Here's how all "
"three methods work on the same query:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/make_your_data_agent_searchable.rst:349
#: f503cd6d248c466aaefb93061bb9faf0
msgid ""
"**Example query:** \"What ECG findings distinguish atrial fibrillation "
"from other arrhythmias?\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/make_your_data_agent_searchable.rst:351
#: 350d95314b0c4481ac6cb5a004a65274
msgid "**1. Keyword Search** — Exact term matching"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/make_your_data_agent_searchable.rst:357
#: e6d5851905744c838fc80ededa658df1
msgid ""
"Returns documents containing those exact words. Fast and precise, but "
"misses context and fails on natural language questions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/make_your_data_agent_searchable.rst:359
#: 9bed13b0fe5247a6b05d30a96d3f7bc2
msgid "**2. Embedding Search** — Semantic understanding"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/make_your_data_agent_searchable.rst:365
#: 8d29d4364313401dbb1383fe195c3e31
msgid ""
"Converts the query to a vector and finds documents with similar meaning. "
"Returns 5 ranked results (e.g., arrhythmia_classification.md at 0.609, "
"ekg_measurements.txt at 0.506). Understands concepts but may include "
"tangentially related documents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/make_your_data_agent_searchable.rst:367
#: be39f09597ae446e8dd496801bf0a8d9
msgid "**3. Hybrid Search** — Best of both (default for agents)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/make_your_data_agent_searchable.rst:373
#: 7a7aea05022e45558e1c48ec0122df0d
msgid ""
"Blends keyword and embedding scores. Documents must be relevant on BOTH "
"dimensions. Stricter ranking, better precision. This is why agents "
"default to hybrid—it balances recall with accuracy."
msgstr ""

